          <h2 id="hdx-title" data-reveal>MOVE THE<br>EXPERIENCE.<br><span>KEEP THE DATA.</span></h2>
          <p class="hdx__intro" data-reveal>
            Citrix HDX is the layer beneath the briefing—designed to deliver responsive, high-fidelity application experiences while applications and sensitive datasets remain in the governed environment.
          </p>

          <div class="hdx__principles" data-reveal>
            <article>
              <span>01</span>
              <div><small>TRANSPORT</small><h3>Adaptive by design</h3><p>Session transport can adapt as network conditions change, protecting continuity without changing the engineer’s workflow.</p></div>
            </article>
            <article>
              <span>02</span>
              <div><small>EXPERIENCE</small><h3>Graphics intelligence</h3><p>Interactive regions remain responsive while detail refines progressively, preserving the feel of a local engineering workstation.</p></div>
            </article>
            <article>
              <span>03</span>
              <div><small>CONTROL</small><h3>Centralized governance</h3><p>The application experience travels to the specialist. The controlled data environment does not.</p></div>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
